From 4b110cf312dc1df4e724d58ebe7f87c8d9315e0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lattice Bridge <bridge@lattice.local>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 23:43:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] lattice: solana-genesis --lattice-network mainnet|testnet

Adds --lattice-network, --lattice-bridge-config (YAML/JSON) and
--lattice-runtime-reserve-lamports to solana-genesis. In Lattice mode:

- --cluster-type development is required, so no Solana genesis stake
  allocations are added and no feature set is cloned over RPC;
- enable_lattice_bridge_program must be active and cannot be deactivated;
- the lattice-bridge state, initial guardian set (epoch 1) and one
  pre-consumed LATMINT1 record per bootstrap deposit are added last;
- mainnet: no faucet, inflation disabled, and genesis lamports plus the
  runtime reserve must be covered by bootstrap deposits (excess backing is
  credited to bootstrap_surplus_recipient); otherwise genesis fails;
- testnet: faucet allowed; uncovered lamports are written to the bridge
  state as genesis_unbacked_native and printed as UNBACKED.

Unaudited.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
